# Requests to try the API from Visual Studio or VS Code (REST Client). Start the API first.
@api = http://localhost:5081

### One page of jobs
GET {{api}}/api/JobCatalog?page=1&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json

### One job in full (use an ID from the page above)
GET {{api}}/api/JobCatalog/4476446382
Accept: application/json

### Invalid page size (400)
GET {{api}}/api/JobCatalog?page=1&pageSize=0

### Unknown job (404)
GET {{api}}/api/JobCatalog/123

### The API description (Development only)
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json
